menuconfig DRIVERS_LIGHTS_MOTOR_LEDS
	bool "motor_leds"
	default n
	depends on PLATFORM_NUTTX
	---help---
		WS2812B LEDs on the motor arms, one per output of one io_timer, all sent
		together by one DMA burst on the timer update event (STM32H7, TIM2-TIM5).
		led_control index n is the arm of motor n, so the board needs
		CONFIG_BOARD_COMPILE_DEFINITIONS="-DBOARD_MAX_LEDS=5".
		Start it before pwm_out and dshot (e.g. CONFIG_BOARD_ADDITIONAL_INIT).
